- They're here in groups.

1337
00:47:18,923 --> 00:47:19,993
They came out of nowhere.

1338
00:47:19,993 --> 00:47:21,823
(The members even start to suspect passersby.)

1339
00:47:21,823 --> 00:47:23,323
- They're not acting, right?
- Be careful!

1340
00:47:23,323 --> 00:47:24,723
(Crashing)

1341
00:47:24,723 --> 00:47:26,163
- Watch out!
- Goodness.

1342
00:47:26,163 --> 00:47:27,363
Are you all right?

1343
00:47:27,363 --> 00:47:28,363
(They're just students surprised to see celebrities.)

1344
00:47:28,363 --> 00:47:30,333
- Hello there.
- Good afternoon.

1345
00:47:30,803 --> 00:47:31,903
Hi!

1346
00:47:31,903 --> 00:47:33,473
Why does everything seem fake?

1347
00:47:33,473 --> 00:47:34,733
I feel the same way too.

1348
00:47:34,733 --> 00:47:37,143
I think this neighbourhood is weird.

1349
00:47:37,143 --> 00:47:38,603
Why do strange things keep happening?

1350
00:47:38,603 --> 00:47:40,413
Remember the convertible?

1351
00:47:40,413 --> 00:47:42,543
You don't run into so many students in uniform...

1352
00:47:42,543 --> 00:47:44,843
- in the afternoon these days.
- Exactly!

1353
00:47:45,583 --> 00:47:46,653
Are we here?

1354
00:47:46,653 --> 00:47:48,183
(While their suspicion grows,)

1355
00:47:48,313 --> 00:47:49,483
Boxing diet?

1356
00:47:49,483 --> 00:47:50,683
(they arrived at the next place.)

1357
00:47:50,683 --> 00:47:52,083
But I heard gunshots.

1358
00:47:52,953 --> 00:47:54,723
(Banging)

1359
00:47:54,723 --> 00:47:56,023
People are flying around.

1360
00:47:56,023 --> 00:47:57,123
