- Right.

1370
00:48:12,273 --> 00:48:13,573
- It's very suspicious.
- Yes.

1371
00:48:13,573 --> 00:48:15,113
(What show will be waiting for them here?)

1372
00:48:15,113 --> 00:48:16,583
- Why don't we go up first?
- Let's go.

1373
00:48:21,783 --> 00:48:23,253
(Exclaiming)

1374
00:48:23,253 --> 00:48:25,023
Is this it?

1375
00:48:25,023 --> 00:48:26,123
Oh, over here.

1376
00:48:26,123 --> 00:48:28,193
Come in at your reserved time.

1377
00:48:28,193 --> 00:48:29,293
