1378
00:48:29,293 --> 00:48:31,263
The seats are first come, first served.

1379
00:48:31,263 --> 00:48:32,933
- People are jumping around?
- Yes.

1380
00:48:32,933 --> 00:48:33,993
(Is it a sign about the show?)

1381
00:48:33,993 --> 00:48:36,433
They must have an action-themed performance...

1382
00:48:36,433 --> 00:48:37,663
inside this place.

1383
00:48:38,303 --> 00:48:41,073
(They open the door and go inside.)

1384
00:48:42,473 --> 00:48:43,743
(Exclaiming)

1385
00:48:45,443 --> 00:48:46,613
It's really quiet.

1386
00:48:47,943 --> 00:48:50,443
(When you step inside the store,)

1387
00:48:51,383 --> 00:48:52,453
(you'll see a huge stage...)

1388
00:48:52,583 --> 00:48:55,683
